    {
      "_why": "…including the British/Canadian spelling. The browser's regex read `che(ck|que)ing`, which expands to `chequeing`, so this account was Cash to the engine and a plain Asset to the browser — and the Balances tab, which requires Cash exactly, dropped it.",
